(text "BUCK - MAX17503  |  Analog Devices (Maxim)  |  4.5-60V 2.5A synchronous buck, TQFN-20 5x5" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 14.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0a81cc2d-8f5d-4667-ba27-3fb6f2fca241"))
(text "Default build: VOUT = 3.3 V (fixed resistor divider - no trimmer). Other outputs: change only R_top/R_bot (and L where shown) per the VOUT table." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "94c682bd-6b53-45c8-a3e5-ed0d900961d5"))
(text "DESIGN EQUATIONS - MAX17503 (Maxim 19-7005, Applications Information)\nDesign point: VIN 24 V nom (6.5-60 V), VOUT 3.3 V, IOUT 2.5 A, fSW 500 kHz (RT open), PFM (MODE open)\nInductor:  L = VOUT/fSW = 6.60 uH -> 6.8 uH ; ISAT > 3.7 A peak current limit\nCrossover: fC = fSW/9 = 55.6 kHz (fSW <= 500 kHz) ; tRESP = 0.33/fC + 1/fSW = 7.94 us\nOutput cap: COUT = 0.5*ISTEP*tRESP/dVOUT (ISTEP 50%, dV 3%) = 50.1 uF eff required\n  Fitted: 47uF/10V X7R 1210 -> ~30.6uF eff @3.3V => step deviation = 162 mV (4.9%)\nFB divider: R3 = 216e3/(fC[kHz]*COUT[uF]) = 127k -> 127k ;  R4 = R3*0.9/(VOUT-0.9) = 47.5k\n  VOUT = 0.9*(1+R3/R4) = 3.306 V\nLoop comp: internal; CF open because fSW >= 500 kHz (Table 2 C6 only below 500 kHz)\nSoft-start: CSS >= 28e-6*CSEL*VOUT = 4.3 nF ; tSS = CSS/5.55uA = 1.80 ms with 10 nF (house-common value)\nEN/UVLO: R1 = 3.32M, R2 = R1*1.215/(VINU-1.215) = 845k for VINU = 6.0 V (VINU > 0.8*VOUT)\nBST: 0.1uF LX-BST. VCC: 2.2uF to SGND. SYNC: tied SGND (unused). RESET: 10k pull-up to VOUT.\nGENERIC CHECKS @ VIN=24V nom / 60V max, VOUT=3.3V, IOUT=2.5A, fSW=500kHz\n  D = VOUT/VIN = 0.137\n  dIL = VOUT(1-VOUT/VIN)/(L*fSW): 0.84A @nom, 0.92A @max  (37% of IOUT)\n  IL_PK = IOUT + dIL/2 = 2.96A ; inductor ISAT must exceed 3.7A (peak current limit)  (XAL6060-682ME: ISAT 9A)\n  ICIN_RMS = IOUT*sqrt(D(1-D)) = 0.86A (max IOUT/2 = 1.25A at D=0.5)\n  dVIN = IOUT*D(1-D)/(fSW*CIN) = 371mV with CIN_eff=1.6uF\n  dVOUT_ripple = dIL/(8*fSW*COUT) = 6.8mV with COUT_eff=30.6uF (ESR excluded)\n  tON @VINmax = VOUT/(VIN*fSW) = 110ns vs tON_MIN(max)=135ns -> pulse skipping possible near VINmax\n  Max VIN without pulse skipping = VOUT/(tON_MIN*fSW) = 48.9V\n  Min VIN (dropout) ~ (VOUT+IOUT*R)/(1-fSW*tOFF_MIN) = 3.72V\nIC THERMAL @ VIN nom, full load (datasheet Power Dissipation / thermal sections)\n  Pcond=IL_RMS^2*1.4*(D*RDS_HS+(1-D)*RDS_LS)=0.81W, Psw=0.5*VIN*IOUT*tsw*fSW=0.30W (tsw~20ns), Pq=0.07W\n  RDS_HS=165mOhm, RDS_LS=80mOhm typ (datasheet EC table)\n  PIC = 1.18W ; thetaJA = 33 C/W (JEDEC) -> TJ = TA + thetaJA*PIC = 64C @25C, 124C @85C ; TA(max) for TJ=125C = 86C\n  Inductor DCR loss = IOUT^2*DCR = 0.16W" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d9b87cc8-7fca-49f5-902f-cb275b72a609"))
