(text "Note: MAX17503 top resistor R3 = 216e3/(fC*COUT_eff) depends on the fitted output capacitance. Non-3.3 V rows assume\nCOUT_eff = minimum from the 50%-step / 3% transient equation; fit capacitors with at least that DC-bias-derated value.\nL column = VOUT/fSW (E12). VIN min ~ VOUT/(1 - fSW*tOFF_MIN) + IR drop." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215.90 185.90 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fcfbd2f8-429b-4eef-93eb-a7a7bc4c7ebe"))
)
